ect.com/science/chapter/handbook/abs/pii/B9780444534293000041#CR14" name=3D=
"bCR14" data-sd-ui-side-panel-opener=3D"true" data-xocs-content-type=3D"ref=
erence" data-xocs-content-id=3D"CR14"><span class=3D"anchor-text-container"=
><span class=3D"anchor-text">14</span></span></a>. To support further resea=
rch and policy interventions, we publicly release privacy-protected statist=
ics on social capital by ZIP code at <span>https://www.socialcapital.org</s=
pan>.</div></div></div></li><li class=3D"related-article-card"><div class=
